BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wolf Cave Creatures\, McCormick's Creek State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260626T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260626T100000
UID:373b5fccf1c55115cdb70a4eea956a6b@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:(Presentation) You will learn how caves are a unique place to 
 live. We will explore how food webs work inside a cave system and how each
  animal has specialized adaptions to survive where sunlight doesn&rsquo\;t
  exist. This program is being held in the Nature Center Auditorium.
LOCATION:McCormick's Creek State Park\, Nature Center\, 250 McCormick's Cr
 eek Park Road\, Spencer\, IN 47460
URL:on.IN.gov/mccormickscreek
X-SOURCE:McCormick's Creek State Park
END:VEVENT
