DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260718T123000
UID:807a6c5062b896c2938b1731355965b6@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:(Hike + Nature Journaling) Can you create art in total darknes
 s? Join Naturalist Kaitlyn for a 2.8 mile round trip hike to Wolf Cave\, w
 here we will crawl through the cave to a small room at the end of the cave
 . There\, we will put your art skills to the test in total darkness. Pleas
 e wear closed toed shoes you don&rsquo\;t mind getting wet. Bring a headla
 mp or flashlight and your artistic skills. &nbsp\;
LOCATION:McCormick's Creek State Park\, Nature Center\, 250 McCormick's Cr
 eek Park Road\, Spencer\, IN 47460
URL:on.in.gov/mccormickscreek
X-SOURCE:McCormick's Creek State Park
END:VEVENT
